OL,3,GNEWSADrones to be used to pinpoint road
OL,4,Adefects and hazards
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighways engineers are to deploy
OL,7,Fspecial drones to help identify
OL,8,Fhard-to-reach defects and hazards with
OL,9,Froad infrastructure.
OL,11,FThe technology has been trialled in
OL,12,FDunstable Road and St Margaret's Road
OL,13,Fin Thurrock, Essex, where steep
OL,14,Fembankments, dense vegetation and
OL,15,Fconfined spaces can often make
OL,16,Ftraditional inspections difficult.
OL,18,FSpecialist drones with high-resolution
OL,19,Fcameras and GPS technology allow
OL,20,Fsurveyors to capture detailed images
OL,21,Fand condition data without putting
OL,22,Fstaff at risk.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
