OL,3,GNEWSADrones to be used to pinpoint road
OL,4,Adefects and hazards
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Using new technology like this can
OL,7,Fhelp us inspect our highway
OL,8,Finfrastructure more safely, quickly and
OL,9,Fefficiently," Thurrock Council leader
OL,10,FRichard Bingley said.
